<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia soyabean oil shipments Jan. 1-31.</title>
<headline>Indonesia soyabean oil shipments Jan. 1-31.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shipments of soyabean oil and its products from Belawan port in North Sumatra in January, 1997, based on data made available to Reuters by the port authority.</p>
<p>* asterisk denotes export destinations.</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>SHIP		DATE/DEPARTURE	CARGO/TONNES     DESTINATION</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>MV Feng Jin	 05-01-97	    soya bean meal   Jakarta</p>
<p>						3,000 tns</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>MV Man Jiang	14-01-97	    soya bean meal   Jakarta</p>
<p>						5,897 tns</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>MV Da Feng	  19-01-97	    soya bean meal   Jakarta</p>
<p>						3,500 tns</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>MV Jin Cheng-     31-01-97	    soya bean meal   S'pore*</p>
<p>Jiang					 3,500 tns</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>-- Jakarta Newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
